            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Wynn Resorts upgraded by Citi, fast casual stocks pop",
            "description": "<p>Market Domination host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> and Yahoo Finance senior reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brooke-dipalma/\">Brooke DiPalma</a> track several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including Citi analysts upgrading their rating on Wynn Resorts (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WYNN\">WYNN</a>) to Buy; shares of fast casual restaurant chains Cava (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CAVA\">CAVA</a>), Chipotle Mexican Grill (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CMG\">CMG</a>), and Sweetgreen (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SG\">SG</a>) popping in Friday's session; and Elastic's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ESTC\">ESTC</a>) stock sliding lower after reporting slowing cloud business growth in its fiscal second quarter results.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
